Vanilla Appliances Extended
Build 42 continuation.

This project continues "Vanilla Appliances Extended", Steam Workshop 3155557729,
which was published without a licence and is no longer updated by its author.

Two different sets of terms apply, because this project cannot grant rights over
work it did not create.


INHERITED WORK

The original mod's artwork, tile definitions and dismantling code remain the
property of their author. No licence was granted upstream, so none is granted
here, and nothing in this file claims one. That material is redistributed on the
same footing it was published on: as a Project Zomboid Workshop mod, with credit,
and subject to removal on request.

This covers, in whole or in part:

  - the appliances_extended_01 artwork and its texture pack
  - VanillaAppliancesExtended.tiles
  - the fridge dismantling context menu and its timed action

NOTICE records what was inherited, what was rewritten, and why.


NEW WORK

Everything written for build 42 in this project is offered under the MIT licence
below. That covers the entity and craft recipe definitions, the tile geometry,
the JSON translations, and the repository tooling and documentation.

The intent is that whoever inherits this mod next is not left where this fork
started: with work worth continuing and no permission to continue it.

